    "whatItIs": "Flodesk is a design-led email marketing platform for creators and small brands, emphasizing polished templates, workflows, and optional checkout/selling on higher plans. Pricing moved to subscriber-based tiers (legacy flat unlimited retired for new members Dec 2025): Lite from $25/mo, Pro from $28/mo, Everything from $54/mo at up to 1,000 subscribers (monthly); Free plan for list-growth tools without full sending; 14-day trial.",
